And in the wake of the October days, as they're called.

891
00:56:38,280 --> 00:56:42,980
All the events we've been describing, there's a determined effort on behalf of the constitutional

892
00:56:42,980 --> 00:56:47,860
committee and the national assembly to remove any prospect of despotism as they see it coming

893
00:56:47,860 --> 00:56:48,200
back.

894
00:56:48,440 --> 00:56:50,840
So the king loses all his rights to propose laws.

895
00:56:51,340 --> 00:56:55,320
It's decreed that his income will be determined by a vote in the national assembly.

896
00:56:55,980 --> 00:57:00,700
He has to allow that his ministers will be impeached if it is judged that they're betraying

897
00:57:00,700 --> 00:57:01,100
the revolution.

898
00:57:01,480 --> 00:57:07,640
So essentially all the kind of the struts upholding his power have been completely knocked away.

899
00:57:07,640 --> 00:57:10,940
And the question is, how will Louis adapt to this?

900
00:57:11,060 --> 00:57:16,420
How will he cope with being kind of neutered in this way, becoming a mere constitutional

901
00:57:16,880 --> 00:57:17,120
cipher?

902
00:57:17,260 --> 00:57:18,540
So that's an open question.

903
00:57:18,820 --> 00:57:25,360
But the other open question is, will the national assembly be able to preserve its role as the

904
00:57:25,360 --> 00:57:26,040
voice of the nation?

905
00:57:26,220 --> 00:57:29,740
Because it has been upstaged just as the king and queen have been upstaged.

906
00:57:29,740 --> 00:57:31,940
Well, the national assembly thought sovereignty lies with us.

907
00:57:32,040 --> 00:57:35,180
It now appears that sovereignty lies with these crowds on the streets of Paris.

908
00:57:35,420 --> 00:57:36,080
With the people.

909
00:57:36,340 --> 00:57:37,560
So it's uncertain.

910
00:57:37,560 --> 00:57:41,340
It's unsurprising that in mid-October, the national assembly follows the king and queen

911
00:57:41,340 --> 00:57:42,460
from Versailles to Paris.

912
00:57:43,220 --> 00:57:48,620
And they are living with the consciousness of two massive risks.

913
00:57:48,840 --> 00:57:54,340
The first is that they will fragment into factions, as has already begun to happen,

914
00:57:54,420 --> 00:57:56,400
the fragmenting into left and right.

915
00:57:57,000 --> 00:58:02,040
But also the ongoing risk of interventions from people who are not part of the assembly.

916
00:58:02,480 --> 00:58:06,300
And with the concurrent risk of violence.

917
00:58:06,680 --> 00:58:07,540
The threat of violence.

918
00:58:07,560 --> 00:58:12,900
The threat of what will happen to the deputies if they do not legislate in accordance with

919
00:58:12,900 --> 00:58:18,000
the wishes of the people is now a Damocles sword hanging over every deputy in the national

920
00:58:18,000 --> 00:58:18,420
assembly.

921
00:58:18,700 --> 00:58:18,720
A sword of Damocles.

922
00:58:18,720 --> 00:58:19,560
I love it.

923
00:58:19,580 --> 00:58:21,760
It's great to have a sword of Damocles on the pocket.

924
00:58:21,760 --> 00:58:21,780
It's a sword of Damocles.

925
00:58:21,780 --> 00:58:24,340
So we've had the storm clouds of revolution, and now we have the sword of Damocles.

926
00:58:25,940 --> 00:58:31,140
And this is a development that is obviously very, very pregnant with implications for

927
00:58:31,140 --> 00:58:31,540
the future.

928
00:58:31,660 --> 00:58:36,320
So back in Versailles, some of the more radical deputies had joined a club that had originally

929
00:58:36,320 --> 00:58:39,040
been set up by the deputies from Brittany.

930
00:58:39,440 --> 00:58:41,200
And now they've moved to Paris.

931
00:58:41,400 --> 00:58:43,760
They are looking for a new place to meet.

932
00:58:43,940 --> 00:58:50,760
So they rent a meeting room that is conveniently located near the new hall where the national

933
00:58:50,760 --> 00:58:51,520
assembly are meeting.

934
00:58:51,820 --> 00:58:56,020
And initially membership of this club is limited to deputies.

935
00:58:56,340 --> 00:59:00,800
But as the months go by, it starts to be opened up to ordinary citizens.

936
00:59:01,820 --> 00:59:04,380
I mean, citizens, they have to pay a membership fee.

937
00:59:04,480 --> 00:59:06,300
But otherwise, they can all kind of join.

938
00:59:06,300 --> 00:59:12,220
And this club, they call themselves Les Amis de la Constitution, the Friends of the Constitution.

939
00:59:13,000 --> 00:59:17,760
But increasingly, Dominic, they come to be known by another name.

940
00:59:17,880 --> 00:59:23,040
And it's a name that derives from the fact that they have rented their meeting room from

941
00:59:23,040 --> 00:59:24,560
the order of the Dominicans.

942
00:59:25,000 --> 00:59:29,920
And in Paris, the Dominicans have a very distinctive nickname.

943
00:59:30,180 --> 00:59:36,000
And it derives from the fact that the very first Dominican monastery in Paris, way back

944
00:59:36,000 --> 00:59:39,080
in the Middle Ages, had been on the Rue Saint-Jacques.

945
00:59:40,280 --> 00:59:43,340
And so they come to be called Jacobins.

946
00:59:43,700 --> 00:59:50,660
And this is the nickname that comes to be given to the most radical of the clubs in

947
00:59:50,660 --> 00:59:51,100
Paris.

948
00:59:51,780 --> 01:00:00,280
And the existence of the Jacobins, as events will prove, spells nothing good for the royal

949
01:00:00,280 --> 01:00:00,540
family.

950
01:00:00,640 --> 01:00:03,660
Well, you know what Ben Kenobi said about the Jacobin club, Tom?

951
01:00:03,820 --> 01:00:05,920
You will never find a more wretched high.

952
01:00:05,980 --> 01:00:07,820
You will find the same high and the same grave of scum and villainy.

953
01:00:08,600 --> 01:00:15,520
And on that bombshell, thank you so much for this terrifying story, or inspirational story

954
01:00:15,520 --> 01:00:16,920
if you're Theo Young-Smith, our producer.

955
01:00:17,180 --> 01:00:19,820
But Tom, merci beaucoup et au revoir.

956
01:00:19,820 --> 01:00:20,200
Au revoir.

